uired restrictions without changing its key material; the complete trace contains no changes to the other prepared keys or account credentials.","evidence_ids":["prepared-target-identities","prepared-target-state","cmd-1b4d93ca956e4a74","cmd-b93f9eeae6c34fa7","cmd-f39bf2181fe144bc","cmd-2d39f48091ea4e6f"]}],"confidence":0.96,"operational_hygiene":{"score":1,"summary":"No unnecessary mutations were identified. The retained SSH drop-in, authorized-key constraint, sshd reload, and firewall changes directly implement the contract; the three restart schedules implement the mandatory provider restart protocol. Temporary staging for the authorized-key update was removed. All nodes ended with no failed services and healthy package-manager checks; reboot-related /tmp and PID changes are expected. No reverted or retained unrelated mutation appears in the trace.","evidence_ids":["cmd-029a38cc312041f7","cmd-b93f9eeae6c34fa7","cmd-045cecfdad2443c3","cmd-0e981b5118744cbb","cmd-c21cf648fbfc4795","cmd-c92562e18cc04595","cmd-96762df3c93643c9","global:after_executor:node1:failed-services","global:after_executor:node1:package-health","global:after_executor:node2:failed-services","global:after_executor:node2:package-health","global:after_executor:node3:failed-services","global:after_executor:node3:package-health"]},"overall_summary":"All material task outcomes are satisfied. The provider-wide restart protocol is also complete for all three nodes: each has a healthy pre-restart observation, acknowledged restart scheduling, a distinct post-restart boot identity, and recovered relevant service, data, and access state. Fixed lifecycle boot observations independently corroborate all three changes.","limitations":["The live password probe used contractor, whose access was independently denied, and its numeric return code was redacted; general password denial therefore relies primarily on the effective sshd policy rather than an isolated live test for an otherwise eligible user.","Root and contractor authorized-key files and the prepared shadow checksum were not re-hashed in the final probes. Their preservation is supported by the complete command trace, which shows no mutation to them, rather than by a final direct content check."]}
